    "Routing criterion (readonly field): 'Largest renewable generation contribution source'.",
    "User goal: 'identify the largest renewable generation contribution source, then route that source record to priority contribution follow-up.'",
    "Option labels: 'Route Solar for priority contribution follow-up', 'Route Wind for priority contribution follow-up', 'Keep Hydroelectric on routine contribution monitoring'."
  ],
  "uncertain": [
    "The printed percentage labels (41.2%, 29.8%, 18.5%, 7.2%, 3.3%) do not match the bar heights on the 0-70 y-axis (e.g., Wind's bar reaches ~68 but is labeled 29.8%; Solar's bar reaches 40 but is labeled 41.2%). It is unclear whether the y-axis represents a different quantity than the percentage labels, or whether one channel is mis-scaled.",
